00:37:28,803 --> 00:37:29,183
So

469
00:37:30,043 --> 00:37:33,466
are the premises true? And do they support the conclusion?

470
00:37:34,485 --> 00:37:37,767
So the reasoning process in an argument should be sound.

471
00:37:38,307 --> 00:37:44,931
A sound argument is one in which the premises are true and they support the conclusion.

472
00:37:47,232 --> 00:37:52,755
The connection between the premise and conclusion should be based on the reason rather than

